{"ticker":"XOM","updated":"2026-10-24T00:37:36Z","profile":{"longName":"ExxonMobil Holdings Corporation","shortName":"ExxonMobil Holdings Corporation","sector":"Energy","industry":"Oil & Gas Integrated","country":"United States","website":"https://corporate.exxonmobil.com","fullTimeEmployees":57900,"marketCap":753343397888,"trailingPE":23.579151,"forwardPE":14.924061,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.086477,"pegRatio":1.54,"targetMeanPrice":179.40909,"targetHighPrice":206.0,"targetLowPrice":142.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":22,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.441,"earningsGrowth":1.128,"grossMargins":0.29767,"operatingMargins":0.15859,"profitMargins":0.09072,"totalRevenue":361060007936,"beta":0.209,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":183.75,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":112.51,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.31},"summary":"ExxonMobil Holdings Corporation engages in the exploration and production of crude oil and natural gas in the United States, Canada, and internationally. The company operates through Upstream, Energy Products, Chemical Products, and Specialty Products segments. Its Upstream segment explores for and produces crude oil and natural gas. The Energy Products segment offers fuels, aromatics, and catalysts, as well as licensing services. Its Chemical Products segment manufactures and sells olefins, polyolefins, and intermediates. The Specialty Products segment offers finished lubricants, basestocks, waxes, synthetics, elastomers, and resins. It is also involved in the manufacture, trade, transport, and sale of crude oil, natural gas, petroleum products, petrochemicals, and other specialty products; and pursuit of lower-emission and business opportunities, including carbon capture and storage, hydrogen, lower-emission fuels, Proxxima resin systems, carbon materials, low-carbon data center, and lithium. In addition, the company offers aviation fuel. It sells its products under the Exxon, Esso, and Mobil brands. The company was formerly known as Exxon Mobil Corporation and changed its name to ExxonMobil Holdings Corporation in July 2026. ExxonMobil Holdings Corporation was founded in 1870 and is headquartered in Spring, Texas.","summary_zh":"埃克森美孚控股公司在美國、加拿大和國際上從事原油和天然氣的勘探和生產。該公司透過上游、能源產品、化學產品和特種產品部門運作。其上游部門勘探和生產原油和天然氣。能源產品部門提供燃料、芳烴和催化劑以及許可服務。其化學產品部門生產和銷售烯烴、聚烯烴和中間體。特種產品部門提供成品潤滑劑、基礎油、蠟、合成材料、彈性體和樹脂。它還涉及原油、天然氣、石油產品、石化產品和其他特殊產品的製造、貿易、運輸和銷售；追求低排放和商業機會，包括碳捕獲和儲存、氫、低排放燃料、Proxxima樹脂系統、碳材料、低碳資料中心和鋰。此外，該公司還提供航空燃料。它以埃克森、埃索和美孚品牌銷售其產品。該公司前身為埃克森美孚公司，於2026年7月更名為埃克森美孚控股公司。埃克森美孚控股公司成立於1870年，總部位於德克薩斯州斯普林。","sector_zh":"活力","industry_zh":"油氣一體化","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":110.9,"h":111.92,"l":110.54,"c":111.74,"v":9744900},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":111.37,"h":111.81,"l":110.36,"c":111.49,"v":18143900},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":111.42,"h":112.98,"l":111.42,"c":112.75,"v":15262600},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":112.87,"h":113.65,"l":112.07,"c":113.35,"v":14189800},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":113.72,"h":114.79,"l":113.58,"c":114.29,"v":14597900},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":114.18,"h":115.24,"l":113.33,"c":114.69,"v":15206700},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":113.97,"h":114.43,"l":111.46,"c":111.91,"v":14920100},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":112.11,"h":113.13,"l":111.38,"c":112.4,"v":12864400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":111.6,"h":111.78,"l":109.02,"c":109.23,"v":16826700},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":109.73,"h":110.05,"l":108.35,"c":109.85,"v":15440500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":110.53,"h":112.51,"l":110.53,"c":110.65,"v":14899500},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":111.16,"h":112.56,"l":110.84,"c":112.5,"v":15837600},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":111.4,"h":112.77,"l":110.87,"c":112.14,"v":11534500},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":112.86,"h":113.22,"l":111.88,"c":112.16,"v":11105700},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":112.18,"h":112.46,"l":111.32,"c":112.35,"v":12880500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":112.96,"h":115.32,"l":112.78,"c":114.68,"v":17208000},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":114.53,"h":115.49,"l":114.05,"c":115.29,"v":13302000},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":115.17,"h":115.35,"l":113.4,"c":113.93,"v":14628700},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":113.9